repository (https://github.com/quickjs-ng/quickjs) at revision
be664ca1ccd86cbadf8df7348b8e15e77a32a1ba (QuickJS-ng 0.11.0), the revision
that Windmill's expression engine runs on (docs/semantics/expressions.md,
JE-1). They are the engine's own sources; the command-line tools, the
standard-library module (quickjs-libc), the tests and the build files are
